Scope: everything in this repository (Blancain Lab), including the code and data
the Triad patch adds to the three games -- the debug menu, the game switch, the
teardown, the font and the stubs its builder emits -- and the pages that apply
it. The games are Capcom's and are not included; no patch here carries their
bytes, and each is applied to the user's own cartridge dumps.
